{{Quote|It's two. Something's wrong on two.|[[Taga]]|<ref name="Nobody's Listening" />}}
'''Level 2''',<ref name="Level 2">{{SWYouTube|H6oSYmFpctM|Andor &#124; What's Happening on Level 2? &#124; Disney+}}</ref> also known as '''Level Two''',<ref name="Nobody's Listening" /> was one of the eight levels<ref name="One Way Out">{{Andor|One Way Out}}</ref> in the prison cylinders of the [[Narkina 5]] [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Narkina 5 Imperial Prison Complex|Prison Complex]].<ref name="Nobody's Listening" /> In [[5 BBY]]<ref name="Date">{{AndorDate|1}}</ref> a prisoner supposedly released from [[Level 4 (Narkina 5)|Level 4]] was accidentally re-admitted to [[unit two-five]] on this level instead of being sent to another [[Prison|facility]]. When word got out of the incident, Two-Five inmates realized that they would not be released after the end of their sentence either, but the [[Unidentified Narkina 5 prison commander|prison commander]] had the entire unit electrocuted while the day and night shifts were on a skybridge, killing all 100 men.<ref name="Nobody's Listening" /> Word still ultimately got out and led to the [[Unit Five-Two-D|Five-Two]] dayshift staging an uprising which spread across the entire facility.<ref name="One Way Out" />

